*=====================================================
* 2-pin SPST switch with parameter control
* Pins: T1 T2
*=====================================================
.SUBCKT SPST T1 T2 PARAMS: STATE=1

.PARAM Ron=1m Roff=10Meg

* Controlled resistors emulate switching
R1 T1 T2 {if(STATE==1, Ron, Roff)}

.ENDS SPST

*=====================================================
* 3-pin SPDT switch with parameter control
* Pins: COM T1 T2
*=====================================================
.SUBCKT SPDT3 COM T1 T2 PARAMS: STATE=1

.PARAM Ron=1m Roff=1Meg

* Controlled resistors emulate switching
R1 COM T1 {if(STATE==1, Ron, Roff)}
R2 COM T2 {if(STATE==2, Ron, Roff)}

.ENDS SPDT3
